  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.96\n\nReleased on 2026-09-30.\n\nTwo Studio editing fixes. An element placed with a stylesheet translate no longer jumps when you move or resize it, and a crop drag that ends where it started no longer adds an undo step.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Studio:** A crop drag that ends where it started saves nothing ([67327a8b2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/67327a8b25a4502b7c29571505be9c575c675ea2), [#4745](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4745)).\n- **Studio:** An element placed by a stylesheet translate stays put after a move or resize ([4825f7929](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4825f792949282d561cdfe32cdcc7fce1cf2605d), [#4734](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4734)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.95...v0.8.96\n"
